{"id":"ea940bfeb1e41d95","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-goodstein-termination.md","title":"本书 Goodstein 变体在 ZFC 中终止","display":"thm-goodstein-termination — 本书 Goodstein 变体在 ZFC 中终止","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-goodstein-termination","aliases":["72-thm-goodstein-termination"],"display":"thm-goodstein-termination — 本书 Goodstein 变体在 ZFC 中终止","depends_on":["[[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Theorem5.6 termination part, print192/PDF204; no Hardy length formula asserted","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-goodstein-termination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-goodstein-termination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-goodstein-termination — 本书 Goodstein 变体在 ZFC 中终止"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1aae99387ae8003d\" href=\"?note=1aae99387ae8003d\" title=\"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent\">72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Theorem5.6 termination part, print192/PDF204; no Hardy length formula asserted"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,a\\in\\omega\">\\(b,a\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 b≥2，序列使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1aae99387ae8003d\" href=\"?note=1aae99387ae8003d\" title=\"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent\">72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent</a>；元理论为 ZFC 的实际序数良基性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ (G_{b,a}(k)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ (G_{b,a}(k)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若所有阶段都正，下降引理给一个无限严格下降的实际序数序列；其值集合非空，取最小值，与下一步更小矛盾。故某阶段为0，之后由吸收分支恒为0。这里只证明终止部分：原书精确终止位置的 Hardy 公式还依赖特定树序数的前驱和基本序列约定；本节点没有把它直接移植到当前通常序数表示。原书 Theorem5.7 的 PA 不可证性也是另一证明义务，本节点未声称已经完成其算术编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent","status":"resolved","id":"1aae99387ae8003d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent","status":"resolved","id":"1aae99387ae8003d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b,a\\in\\omega$ 且 b≥2，序列使用 [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]]；元理论为 ZFC 的实际序数良基性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b,a\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ (G_{b,a}(k)=0).","display":true}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-494","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-489","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"56f6604e5f04b50c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b\\ge2$，$a\\in\\omega$，G 与终止性取 [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]。$\\ell_G$ 在下式定义，按从0起的步数计数，不是原书从 x 起的绝对阶段编号。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-489","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"2ae8cb47602b25cd","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[../72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[../72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[../72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[../72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[../72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[../72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[../72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[../72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[../72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"57199c40d155f4ba","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"}],"outgoing":["1aae99387ae8003d"]}